  <text>
    <status value="generated"/><div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p class="res-header-id"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap jp-condition-disease-outcome-hl70241-to-snomed</b></p><a name="jp-condition-disease-outcome-hl70241-to-snomed"> </a><a name="hcjp-condition-disease-outcome-hl70241-to-snomed"> </a><p>Mapping from <a href="CodeSystem-jp-condition-disease-outcome-hl70241-cs.html">http://jpfhir.jp/fhir/core/CodeSystem/HL70241</a> to <a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-snomedct.html">http://snomed.info/sct</a></p><br/><p><b>Group 1 </b>Mapping from <a href="CodeSystem-jp-condition-disease-outcome-hl70241-cs.html">JP Core Condition Disease Outcome HL7 Table 0241 - Patient Outcome CodeSystemversion: 1.3.0-dev)</a> to <a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-snomedct.html">SNOMED CT (all versions)</a></p><table class="grid"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td>D (死亡)</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent" title="equivalent">is equivalent to</a></td><td>419099009 (Dead (finding))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>R (回復)</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#wider" title="wider">maps to wider concept</a></td><td>371236003 (Patient's condition improved (finding))</td><td>「回復」は改善全般を指し、完全回復（F）も含むため、SNOMED CT の「改善」にマップ。完全回復（F）との区別は本マッピングでは #R を wider として扱う。</td></tr><tr><td>N (回復せず／変わらない)</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent" title="equivalent">is equivalent to</a></td><td>271299001 (Patient's condition unchanged (finding))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>W (悪化)</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent" title="equivalent">is equivalent to</a></td><td>371240007 (Patient's condition worsened (finding))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>S (後遺症)</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#inexact" title="inexact">maps loosely to</a></td><td>302898002 (Sequela (morphologic abnormality))</td><td>SNOMED CT の Sequela は形態的異常として分類されており、HL70241 の意味と完全一致はしない。代替として 444784007 (Complication of illness) の使用も検討されたい。</td></tr><tr><td>F (完全に回復した)</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent" title="equivalent">is equivalent to</a></td><td>370996005 (Patient's condition resolved (finding))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>U (未知)</td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent" title="equivalent">is equivalent to</a></td><td>261665006 (Unknown (qualifier value))</td><td/></tr></table></div>
